  ],
  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "View PDF",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You should review all activities undertaken for the contract. This will help you understand which areas performed well and areas for development. The areas identified should be acted upon to make improvements for the future.",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Lessons learned can be undertaken at any time during the procurement process, for example:",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "table",
      "text": "After a contract has been awarded\tTo understand the areas that need to be amended for the future\nDuring the lifetime of the contract\tIn order to incorporate any best practice/problem solving identified or implemented as soon as possible to reap any benefits\nAfter the contract has ended\tTo aid future decisions and new contracts",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {
        "rows": [
          [
            "After a contract has been awarded",
            "To understand the areas that need to be amended for the future"
          ],
          [
            "During the lifetime of the contract",
            "In order to incorporate any best practice/problem solving identified or implemented as soon as possible to reap any benefits"
          ],
          [
            "After the contract has ended",
            "To aid future decisions and new contracts"
          ]
        ],
        "row_count": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "After a contract has been awarded",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "To understand the areas that need to be amended for the future",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "During the lifetime of the contract",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In order to incorporate any best practice/problem solving identified or implemented as soon as possible to reap any benefits",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "After the contract has ended",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "To aid future decisions and new contracts",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "All staff and suppliers involved with the bid can be asked for feedback. These people may be in your organisation or external to your organisation e.g. bidders.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Feedback can be provided in a number of ways e.g. face to face meetings, online feedback, etc. and given by a variety of roles e.g. bidder contract managers, procurement officers, logistics, estate managers, etc. However you should ensure that these people understand the process and are trained/experienced in providing this kind of feedback.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Quickfire Guide",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Lessons Learned - Example Questions",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Questions which could be asked are:",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "what worked well?",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "what didn’t work well?",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "what would you do differently in the future?",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "were there any unresolved problems?",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "were any innovations, workarounds or solutions used? If so, what improvements resulted?",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "do you have ideas for improvements for future contracts?",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "what contract areas were most important to you/your department?",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "what issues occurred which were not anticipated?",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "what extra costs occurred?",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "were there processes used that could be improved upon?",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "were there processes that are not needed?",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00026",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "can ICT (Information and Communications Technology) systems be used to improve performance?",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00027",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Changes identified may not be in procurement areas e.g. you may suggest improving communications and/or processes between internal departments.",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00028",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "It must be recognised that any lessons learned data could be subject to a freedom of information request. As a result any information held should be objective.",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00029",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You have now completed Route 1.",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00030",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Please remember that procurement is a continual process: continue to use lessons learned in all procurement exercises.",
      "ordinal": 30,
      "heading_path": [
        "Lessons Learned - Example Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    }
  ],
